Package: textrecipes
Title: Extra 'Recipes' for Text Processing
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: c( person("Emil", "Hvitfeldt", , "emil.hvitfeldt@posit.co",
        role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID =
        "0000-0002-0679-1945")), person("Michael W.", "Kearney", ,
        "kearneymw@missouri.edu", role = "cph", comment = "author of
        count_functions"), person("Posit Software, PBC", role =
        c("cph", "fnd"), comment = c(ROR = "03wc8by49")) )
Description: Converting text to numerical features requires
        specifically created procedures, which are implemented as steps
        according to the 'recipes' package. These steps allows for
        tokenization, filtering, counting (tf and tfidf) and feature
        hashing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tidymodels/textrecipes,
